# Development environments
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Claude Code session worktrees and local settings. A session creates its worktree in the
# current directory, so sometimes inside this one, and each is a full copy of the repository.
# Until this folder became a repository of its own the rule lived in the monorepo's .gitignore,
# a file this repository does not carry.
.claude/

# Local asset-rendering dependencies
_tools/node_modules/

# System.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Local Windows folder icons: a derived copy of Preview.png for the Explorer, never published.
Art/*.ico

# RimWorld converts every PNG to a .dds next to it the first time the game loads the mod.
# Never tracked, and Steam must not ship them either.
*.dds

# Pickle's -EvidenceDir target. Proof kept on disk for the session that reads it, not in git:
# screenshots and Player.log grow without limit. One text line per run goes in docs/runs/.
Tests/Pickle/Evidence/
evidence/
